The *.xsd files in this directory are vendored unmodified from the GraphML
project (http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/):

  http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd
  http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml-structure.xsd
  http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml-attributes.xsd
  http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml-parseinfo.xsd
  http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/xlink.xsd

GraphML is (c) the GraphML Working Group and is licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 3.0 License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). No changes were made.

catalog.xml is not part of GraphML: it maps the schemas' absolute
schemaLocation URLs onto these local copies so validation runs offline.
